            "sid": "HOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova waŋilili nindi, Yaku cheŋi wakakeŋi mumbanda akeŋawukudi kajila kindi, wela dehi chivumbi, neyi chakeŋeluwu anyana kaIsarela kudi Yehova, hela tuhu atalisha mesu awu kudi akishi, hela tuhu akeŋa mankendi anyikabu yavinyu yawuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi namulandili namali asiliva ikumi natanu, niibaŋu dabali denzala, niibaŋu dabali danketenki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumwila nami, Shakamaku wikali wami mafuku amavulu; bayi wakakoŋakoŋa wuvumbuku, bayi wakekala iŋodamuntu wacheŋuku; ninami nawa nakekala weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋanyana kaIsarela akashakama mafuku amavulu chakadi mwanta, chakadi kalamba, chakadi kuketula yimuna, chakadi kaposhi kakupeshela, chakadi ifwodi, hela nkishi yakupanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkumininaku anyana kaIsarela akafunta, akakeŋakeŋa Nzambi yawu Yehova, nimwanta wawu Davidi; hamafuku akukuminina akenza kudi Yehova nikukuwaha kwindi nawoma hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
